lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="130" width="220" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ca" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Canary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;5% → 20% → 100% theo nhóm người dùng/site&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="130" width="250" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="er" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Phân tích lỗi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;dữ liệu · feature · prompt · retrieval · model · rule&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DC2626;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="300" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mo" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Giám sát production&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;drift · hallucination · latency p95 · tỷ lệ sửa tay · feedback&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="300" width="250" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Vượt ngưỡng?&lt;/b&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="290" width="170" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rb" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Rollback cả bộ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;model + prompt + preprocessing + index + rule theo manifest&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DC2626;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="300" width="210" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_c_ev" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c" target="ev"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2_ev_g" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ev" target="g"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3_u_sh" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="u" target="sh"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4_sh_ca" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sh" target="ca"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5_mo_g2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mo" target="g2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6_g_u" value="Đạt" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="g" target="u"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7_g_er" value="Không" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="g" target="er"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e8_er_c" value="vòng sau" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="er" target="c"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e9_ca_mo" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ca" target="mo"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e10_g2_rb" value="Có" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="g2" target="rb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e11_g2_mo" value="Không · tiếp tục" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="g2" target="mo"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="crit" value="&lt;b&gt;Tiêu chí gate (ví dụ HRAI / OCR / RAG)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Macro-F1 ≥ bản production; recall nhóm rủi ro trọng yếu ≥ ngưỡng đã ký&lt;br&gt;• False positive / false accept không tăng; không slice nào giảm quá mức cho phép&lt;br&gt;• OCR: field exact match theo trường critical; RAG: citation đúng, NO_EVIDENCE đúng&lt;br&gt;• Hallucination (thông tin không có trong input) = 0 trên bộ critical&lt;br&gt;• Latency p95, cost/request trong ngân sách; JSON hợp lệ 100%&lt;br&gt;• Có model card, dataset manifest, người duyệt (AI Lead + chủ nghiệp vụ)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#7C3AED;fillColor=#F5F3FF;spacing=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="430" width="760" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rule" value="&lt;b&gt;Nguyên tắc QC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Test set độc lập không được dùng để sửa model rồi vẫn gọi là test&lt;br&gt;• Mọi so sánh ghi rõ version dữ liệu, model, prompt, index&lt;br&gt;• Một thay đổi tăng điểm tổng nhưng giảm một nhóm quan trọng = regression&lt;br&gt;• Kết quả nghiệm thu lưu kèm evidence để truy vết RTM" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#059669;fillColor=#ECFDF5;spacing=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="430" width="650" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>